sequenceDiagram
    participant SYSTEM as System Scheduler
    participant WS as Workflow Service
    participant CE as Condition Evaluator
    participant DB as Database
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant MOBILE as Mobile App
    participant FS as Field Staff
    participant AS as Audit Service
    participant CACHE as Redis Cache
    
    Note over SYSTEM,CACHE: Conditional Health Facility Activation Workflow
    
    SYSTEM->>WS: Trigger periodic activation check
    Note over SYSTEM: Runs every 15 minutes via cron job
    
    WS->>DB: Query facilities with SCHEDULED status
    DB-->>WS: Return scheduled facility activities
    
    loop For each scheduled facility activity
        WS->>CE: Evaluate activation conditions
        CE->>DB: Check activity dependencies
        
        Note over CE,DB: Evaluating different condition types
        
        alt Installation Activity Conditions
            CE->>DB: Check if Assessment completed with "GO" recommendation
            DB-->>CE: Return assessment status
            
            alt Assessment Status = "GO"
                CE->>CE: Mark condition as MET
            else Assessment Status != "GO" or Not Found
                CE->>CE: Mark condition as NOT_MET
            end
            
        else Field QC Activity Conditions
            CE->>DB: Check if Installation report flagged for Field QC
            DB-->>CE: Return installation flag status
            
            alt Installation Flagged for Field QC
                CE->>CE: Mark condition as MET
            else Not Flagged for Field QC
                CE->>CE: Mark condition as NOT_MET
            end
            
        else Handover Activity Conditions
            CE->>DB: Check if Installation AND Field QC completed
            DB-->>CE: Return completion status
            
            alt Both Installation and Field QC Complete
                CE->>CE: Mark condition as MET
            else Prerequisites Not Complete
                CE->>CE: Mark condition as NOT_MET
            end
            
        else Custom Project Conditions
            CE->>DB: Evaluate custom conditions defined for project
            DB-->>CE: Return condition evaluation results
            CE->>CE: Apply custom business rules
        end
        
        CE->>CE: Aggregate all condition results
        CE-->>WS: Return overall condition status
        
        alt All Conditions Met for Activation
            WS->>DB: Begin transaction
            WS->>DB: Update facility_activities status to ACTIVE
            WS->>DB: Set activated_at timestamp
            WS->>DB: Update conditions_met JSONB field
            DB-->>WS: Activation recorded
            
            WS->>CACHE: Update facility status cache
            CACHE-->>WS: Cache updated
            
            WS->>AS: Log activation event
            AS->>DB: Store activation audit
            DB-->>AS: Audit logged
            
            WS->>DB: Commit transaction
            DB-->>WS: Activation committed
            
            WS->>NS: Send activation notification
            NS->>NS: Prepare activation message
            NS->>MOBILE: Send push notification to assigned field staff
            
            Note over NS,MOBILE: Real-time notification if field staff online
            MOBILE-->>FS: Show "New facility activated for [Activity]"
            
            WS->>WS: Add to activation summary
            
        else Conditions Not Met
            Note over WS: Facility remains SCHEDULED
            WS->>WS: Continue to next facility
            
        else Conditions Changed (Previously Active)
            Note over WS,DB: Handle edge case where conditions no longer met
            WS->>DB: Check if facility should be deactivated
            
            alt Deactivation Required
                WS->>DB: Begin transaction
                WS->>DB: Update status to SCHEDULED
                WS->>DB: Clear activated_at timestamp
                DB-->>WS: Deactivation recorded
                
                WS->>AS: Log deactivation event
                AS->>DB: Store deactivation audit
                DB-->>AS: Audit logged
                
                WS->>DB: Commit transaction
                DB-->>WS: Deactivation committed
                
                WS->>NS: Send deactivation notification
                NS->>MOBILE: Notify field staff of deactivation
                MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Facility deactivated - conditions changed"
            end
        end
    end
    
    WS->>WS: Generate activation summary report
    Note over WS: Summary: X facilities activated, Y remain scheduled
    
    WS->>AS: Log batch processing audit
    AS->>DB: Store batch audit record
    DB-->>AS: Batch audit logged
    
    WS-->>SYSTEM: Return activation summary
    
    Note over SYSTEM,CACHE: Manual Activation Triggers
    
    participant PM as Project Manager
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant API as API Gateway
    
    PM->>UI: Manually trigger activation check
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/field-plans/{id}/check-activation
    API->>WS: Trigger manual activation check
    
    WS->>CE: Evaluate conditions for specific field plan
    CE->>DB: Check conditions for field plan facilities
    
    loop For each facility in field plan
        CE->>CE: Evaluate all activation conditions
        CE-->>WS: Return condition status
        
        alt Conditions Met
            WS->>DB: Begin transaction
            WS->>DB: Update facility status to ACTIVE
            WS->>DB: Set activation timestamp and conditions
            DB-->>WS: Facility activated
            
            WS->>CACHE: Update cache
            WS->>AS: Log manual activation
            AS->>DB: Store audit with "MANUAL_TRIGGER" flag
            DB-->>AS: Manual audit logged
            
            WS->>DB: Commit transaction
            
            WS->>NS: Send activation notifications
            NS->>MOBILE: Notify assigned field staff
            MOBILE-->>FS: Show activation notification
            
        else Conditions Not Met
            Note over WS: Log reason for non-activation
            WS->>AS: Log failed activation attempt
            AS->>DB: Store failed activation reason
            DB-->>AS: Failed activation logged
        end
    end
    
    WS->>WS: Generate manual activation report
    WS-->>API: Return activation results
    API-->>UI: Display activation summary
    UI-->>PM: Show "X facilities activated, Y conditions not met"
    
    Note over SYSTEM,CACHE: Condition Configuration Management
    
    participant ADMIN as System Admin
    
    ADMIN->>UI: Configure activity conditions
    UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/activities/{id}/conditions
    API->>WS: Update activity conditions
    
    WS->>DB: Begin transaction
    WS->>DB: Update activity default_conditions
    WS->>DB: Version the condition changes
    DB-->>WS: Conditions updated
    
    WS->>CACHE: Clear condition cache
    CACHE-->>WS: Cache cleared
    
    WS->>AS: Log condition configuration change
    AS->>DB: Store configuration audit
    DB-->>AS: Configuration audit logged
    
    WS->>DB: Commit transaction
    DB-->>WS: Configuration committed
    
    WS-->>API: Conditions updated successfully
    API-->>UI: Return success response
    UI-->>ADMIN: Show "Activity conditions updated"
    
    Note over ADMIN: Changes apply to new facility activities
    
    Note over SYSTEM,CACHE: Project-Specific Condition Overrides
    
    PM->>UI: Override conditions for specific project
    UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/projects/{id}/activity-conditions
    API->>WS: Update project-specific conditions
    
    WS->>DB: Begin transaction
    WS->>DB: Store project condition overrides
    WS->>DB: Version the override changes
    DB-->>WS: Overrides stored
    
    WS->>AS: Log project condition override
    AS->>DB: Store override audit
    DB-->>AS: Override audit logged
    
    WS->>DB: Commit transaction
    DB-->>WS: Overrides committed
    
    WS->>CACHE: Update project condition cache
    CACHE-->>WS: Cache updated
    
    WS-->>API: Project conditions updated
    API-->>UI: Return success response
    UI-->>PM: Show "Project-specific conditions applied"
    
    Note over PM: Overrides affect only this project's facilities
    
    Note over SYSTEM,CACHE: Error Handling and Recovery
    
    alt Condition Evaluation Error
        CE->>CE: Handle evaluation exception
        CE->>AS: Log condition evaluation error
        AS->>DB: Store error details
        DB-->>AS: Error logged
        
        CE-->>WS: Return evaluation failed
        WS->>WS: Skip facility and continue processing
        WS->>NS: Send error notification to admin
        NS->>ADMIN: Alert about condition evaluation failure
        
    else Database Transaction Error
        WS->>DB: Rollback failed transaction
        WS->>AS: Log transaction failure
        AS->>DB: Store transaction error
        DB-->>AS: Error logged
        
        WS->>NS: Send system error notification
        NS->>ADMIN: Alert about system error
        
    else Cache Error
        WS->>CACHE: Handle cache failure gracefully
        WS->>WS: Continue processing without cache
        WS->>AS: Log cache error
        AS->>DB: Store cache error details
        DB-->>AS: Cache error logged
    end
    
    Note over SYSTEM,CACHE: Conditional activation system ensures proper workflow sequencing 